From: StonkGuy <68372320+StonkGuy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 01:40:48 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] rutabaga_gfx(macos): wmtr context type for remoted DXMT
 winemetal calls

Add an opt-in virtio-gpu context type (capset 30, "wmtr") whose guest
process forwards DXMT's winemetal unix calls through a shared-memory ring
to a host executor that runs them against Metal. The executor is a
separate library (libwmtr_host.dylib, STEAMAC_WMTR_LIB or the default
name) loaded with dlopen; this patch only carries the transport:

- blobs (blob_id = ring/buffer number, at most 1024) are POSIX shared
  memory, mapped into the guest by the existing SHM blob path and into
  the VMM for the executor;
- EXECBUFFER carries 24-byte commands: RING (blob 0 is initialised:
  start the executor), KICK (wake it), WAIT (the next fence on this ring
  completes when the executor's reply slot reaches the sequence number;
  progress is checked and the waiter queued under one lock, so a reply
  cannot slip between them); fences on rings without a WAIT complete at
  once, and pending ones complete when the context is destroyed;
- the capset id is below 32 because VIRTGPU_PARAM_SUPPORTED_CAPSET_IDs
  reports a 32-bit mask; no stock rutabaga capset uses 30.

The component exists only with STEAMAC_WMTR=1 and a loadable library
that exports the host API (one cached load shared by the device's config
space and the rutabaga builder). Then num_capsets counts it: the stock 5
covers virgl, virgl2, venus, drm and cross-domain, and the guest never
asks for an index at or above that count. Without it nothing changes:
no library is loaded and the guest sees the same five capsets.

Unit tests (cargo test --lib wmtr in rutabaga_gfx, against a stand-in
executor: no Metal, no library): off unless enabled; a WAIT fence stays
pending until the reply and completes on it; satisfied WAITs and
fences without a WAIT complete at once; pending fences complete on
context drop and the executor is destroyed; malformed blobs and
commands are rejected. virtio::gpu: num_capsets stays 5 without
STEAMAC_WMTR.
